Document dependency of libmd specifically instead of libbsd more broadly.

Most platforms seem to package libmd independently with libbsd, with libbsd,
if it has a package at all, listing it as a dependency.  Targeting libmd
specifically should make the documentation clearer across supported platforms.

Detection of MD5 support on macOS (via Homebrew) is also improved, and
included workaround for symbol clashes with macOS's libSystem built-in MD5
functions.
